  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "瑪琪艾兒的搭檔\n喵茸的照片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A742A827E51527684642D6A94000A55B5833876847167724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來是瑪琪艾兒負責的\n委託的相關文件。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F86662F746A742A827E51528CA08CAC7684000A59D48A17768476F895DC65874EF630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "或許是因為不常使用，\n水槽並沒有很髒。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62168A31662F56E070BA4E0D5E384F7F7528FF0C000A6C3469FD4E266C9267095F889AD230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來很愉快的喵茸和\n穿著西裝的男性的照片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F865F8861095FEB768455B58338548C000A7A7F8457897F88DD76847537602776847167724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來很開心的喵茸和\n護目鏡很搶眼的男性的照片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F865F88958B5FC3768455B58338548C000A8B7776EE93E15F886436773C76847537602776847167724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要在ZA登峰戰獲勝，\n跟對手之間的位置關係是很重要的呢～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C89815728005A0041767B5CF06230737252DDFF0C000A8DDF5C0D624B4E4B959376844F4D7F6E95DC4FC2662F5F8891CD898176845462FF5E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我得到了失控超級進化的情報，\n但是超Z隊的大家肯定不會有問題的～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F9752304E86593163A78D857D1A90325316768460C55831FF0C000A4F46662F8D85005A968A768459275BB680AF5B9A4E0D67036709554F984C7684FF5E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "打聽一下有沒有人知道\n關於沐淨的事吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6253807D4E004E0B67096C9267094EBA77E59053000A95DC65BC6C906DE876844E8B5427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還好沐淨的神奇事件\n最後平安解決了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084597D6C906DE87684795E59474E8B4EF6000A67005F8C5E735B8989E36C7A4E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "名為F的那個人物\n為什麼會跟基格爾德10％待在一起呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540D70BA0046768490A3500B4EBA7269000A70BA4EC09EBC67038DDF57FA683C723E5FB700310030FF055F8557284E008D775462FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的ZA登峰戰級別\n提升得很順利嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B37684005A0041767B5CF062307D1A5225000A63D053475F975F8898065229561B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有沒有靈活運用超級進化？\n這是有效對抗失控超級進化的手段，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且更重要的是AZ的願望是\n找到最強的超級進化行家嘛～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B367096C92670997486D3B904B75288D857D1A90325316FF1F000A9019662F670965485C0D6297593163A78D857D1A903253167684624B6BB5FF0C00100001BE01000A800C4E1466F491CD89817684662F0041005A76849858671B662F000A627E523067005F3776848D857D1A90325316884C5BB6561BFF5E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管我怎麼調查，\n都搞不清楚F這個人物的目的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n第二代所長做成這副德性真是令人難為情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA16211600E9EBC8ABF67E5FF0C000A90FD641E4E0D6E05695A00469019500B4EBA7269768476EE76842026202600100001BE00000A7B2C4E8C4EE362409577505A62109019526F5FB76027771F662F4EE44EBA96E370BA60C5300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稜鏡塔的異常……\n不管發生什麼事，我都要守護密阿雷的和平。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因為我跟大叔已經說好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A1C93E15854768475705E3820262026000A4E0D7BA1767C751F4EC09EBC4E8BFF0C621190FD89815B888B775BC6963F96F77684548C5E73300200100001BE00000A56E070BA62118DDF592753D45DF27D938AAA597D4E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在密阿雷有許多\n有困擾的寶可夢和人們喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BC6963F96F767098A31591A000A670956F064FE76845BF653EF5922548C4EBA50115594FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "白板上彙整了各式各樣\n關於委託的資訊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
